# Media never lives here: sources, renders, stages and cuts go to ~/kb-scratch/video/animate-flow/<slug>/.
# Text artifacts (run-config, transcript, moments, compositions, feedback) are committed.
videos/*/review/
# Logo copies: restored from card-library/logos at review and render time (lib/assets.mjs).
videos/*/moments/*/assets/
videos/*/storyboard/*/assets/
*.mp4
*.wav
*.mp3
.test-tmp/
